sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgb(240, 248, 255) Agent 层
    participant LLM as LLM Agent
    end

    box rgb(255, 248, 240) 检索层
    participant Tool as SearchKnowledgeTool
    participant Emb as EmbeddingModel
    end

    box rgb(248, 255, 240) Milvus v2
    participant MV as MilvusClientV2
    end

    box rgb(255, 240, 248) 融合精排
    participant Fuse as FusionService
    participant Rerank as RerankService
    end

    Note over LLM, Rerank: ─── 混合检索流程（searchSingle）───

    LLM->>Tool: searchKnowledge(List<TypedQuery>)
    Tool->>Tool: searchInParallel(queries)
    Note over Tool: CompletableFuture.supplyAsync per query

    loop 每条 TypedQuery
        Tool->>Emb: embed(query.queryText())
        Emb-->>Tool: float[] denseVector (1024-dim)

        Tool->>Tool: buildFilterExpression(query)
        Note over Tool: "collection_type == "TECHNICAL_QA"<br/>and (course_id == "DEFAULT"<br/>or course_id in ["C1","C2"])"

        Tool->>Tool: 构建 AnnSearchReq × 2
        Note over Tool: dense: FloatVec(denseVector),<br/>vectorFieldName="dense_vector",<br/>metricType=COSINE, params={"ef":64}, limit=20
        Note over Tool: sparse: EmbeddedText(queryText),<br/>vectorFieldName="sparse_vector",<br/>metricType=BM25, limit=20

        Tool->>MV: hybridSearch(HybridSearchReq)
        Note over MV: 服务端：EmbeddedText → BM25 sparse 向量<br/>dense HNSW 检索 + sparse SPARSE_INVERTED_INDEX 检索<br/>RRFRanker(k=60) 融合 → topK=20

        MV-->>Tool: SearchResp (getSearchResults)
        Tool->>Tool: 解析 → List<KnowledgeChunk>
        Note over Tool: 字段映射：chunk_id, doc_id, kb_id,<br/>content, heading_path, chunk_index,<br/>token_count, collection_type, course_id
    end

    Tool->>Fuse: fuse(rawResults)
    Note over Fuse: 跨查询 RRF 融合 + 去重
    Fuse-->>Tool: List<KnowledgeChunk> fused

    Tool->>Rerank: rerank(anchorQuery, fused)
    Rerank-->>Tool: List<KnowledgeChunk> reranked

    Tool-->>LLM: KnowledgeSearchResult(reranked)

    Note over LLM, Rerank: ────────────────────────────────

    box rgb(240, 240, 255) ETL 层
    participant ETL as EtlPipeline
    participant DB as DocumentMapper/ChunkMapper
    participant Minio as MinioStorageService
    end

    Note over LLM, MV: ─── ETL 插入流程（embedAndIndex → insertToMilvus）───

    ETL->>DB: selectList(docId) → List<DocumentChunk>
    ETL->>MV: delete(filter="chunk_id in [...]")

    loop 每个 chunk
        ETL->>Emb: embed(chunk.content)
        Emb-->>ETL: float[] denseVector

        ETL->>DB: update dense_vector (BYTEA) + milvus_pk
        ETL->>ETL: buildMilvusRow(chunk, denseVector)
        Note over ETL: Gson JsonObject:<br/>chunk_id, doc_id, kb_id, content,<br/>heading_path, dense_vector(List<Float>),<br/>chunk_index, token_count,<br/>collection_type, course_id, updated_at<br/>【不含 sparse_vector — 服务端自动生成】

        ETL->>MV: insert(InsertReq.data(List.of(rowJson)))
        Note over MV: BM25 Function 自动：<br/>content → tokenize → sparse_vector
    end

    ETL->>DB: update status = "INDEXED"
